WEBVTT

00:52.684 --> 00:56.980
EPISODE 15
BAADAL AUR BAARISH

01:21.880 --> 01:23.173
NICHE..

01:46.863 --> 01:47.697
UTHAAO

01:47.781 --> 01:48.782
SIDE PLANK

01:59.626 --> 02:02.045
MEITEN HIGH SCHOOL

03:28.048 --> 03:29.466
KELE KA DRINK
PAKE KELE KI HALKI MITHAAS

03:38.058 --> 03:39.017
PIYO

04:36.116 --> 04:37.492
ARE, KYA?
KYA MUJH PAR HAMLA HO RAHA HAI?

04:37.575 --> 04:38.785
DOSHI BHAVNA

04:48.211 --> 04:49.379
MUSKAAN

05:33.256 --> 05:34.674
ANDAR AANA MANA HAI

07:13.690 --> 07:15.608
HUH? MAIN?
TUM KAUN HO?

07:17.694 --> 07:19.612
MUJHE LAGTA HAI HO SAKTA HAI WO
ACCHA LADKA HO.

07:23.074 --> 07:28.288
MUJHE PHIR SE CHOR DIYA!

07:28.496 --> 07:32.584
THIK HAI, JO BHI HO
MAIN IS BAARE MEIN BHOL JAUNGA

08:21.257 --> 08:22.175
YE BOHOT SPASHT HAI

09:48.761 --> 09:50.722
CHEER SQUAD MEIN KUCH SAMAY BAAD JO LOG
MILNA JULNA SHURU KAR DETE HAIN

09:58.938 --> 10:00.523
SACH MEIN?

10:10.742 --> 10:11.576
HAHAHA

10:11.701 --> 10:12.910
BACHNA?

10:26.716 --> 10:28.384
GRADE 2 CLASS 2

10:42.398 --> 10:43.316
TUM THIK HO?

10:43.399 --> 10:45.276
TUM CHAHTE HO MAIN IS BAARE MEIN BAAT KARU?

10:45.360 --> 10:46.319
YOTA KE BAARE MEIN

10:46.402 --> 10:48.154
AMAMIYA-KUN KE BAARE MEIN

10:50.865 --> 10:53.076
YE SHARMNAAK HAI

10:53.159 --> 10:55.703
MUJHE APNE MAN KA BOJH HALKA KARNA HAI

10:55.787 --> 10:57.914
AGAR USE AJEEB LAGA TOH?

13:46.541 --> 13:48.459
AASU BEH RAHE HAIN

15:57.713 --> 16:01.133
SHABDAAWALI KI SEEMA MEIN GIRAWAT

16:34.333 --> 16:36.002
SABHI GALATFEHMIYAN DOOR HO GAI

17:45.529 --> 17:46.947
KAMUKTA

18:50.886 --> 18:54.932
SUJI HUI AAKHEIN

19:28.924 --> 19:30.593
INKAAR KARNA MUSHKIL

21:28.919 --> 21:30.921
KACHRE KO THIK SE CHHATEIN!

23:45.097 --> 23:46.849
MUSKAAN
